OL,3,GNEWSANew coin revealed with hidden
OL,4,Amessages celebrating Cluedo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Mint has unveiled a new
OL,7,Fcollectible coin celebrating the board
OL,8,Fgame Cluedo.
OL,10,FThe 50p coin design includes all six of
OL,11,Fthe game's characters and in a nod to
OL,12,Fthe detective work required of players,
OL,13,Fit conceals intricate microtext
OL,14,Frevealed only by a magnifying glass
OL,15,Fcontaining their names, locations and
OL,16,Fweapons.
OL,18,FThe Cluedo stage play actress Ellie
OL,19,FLeach revealed the design as Miss
OL,20,FScarlett alongside Marcia Lewis,
OL,21,Fdaughter of the iconic board game's
OL,22,Fcreators Anthony and Elva Pratt.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
